# Force LF for code/text so the sealed sha256 of every input is identical on Windows, Linux and CI.
* text=auto eol=lf
# The UCI dataset is sealed by sha256 and stored VERBATIM (its original CRLF line endings) — treat it as
# binary so git never normalises it; otherwise the committed blob would differ from what the seal hashed.
*.csv -text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
